      "options": {
        "content": "# Nitro Overview\n\nDashboards for the publicly released Nitro components, published from\n[OffchainLabs/ocl-dashboards](https://github.com/OffchainLabs/ocl-dashboards).\nSee the README shipped alongside these dashboards for the label, pod-naming and\nevent-stream conventions they expect.\n\nBelow are links for each component. These links include your currently selected variables and time range.\n\n## Validator\n\n- [Validator Summary](/d/community-validator_summary?orgId=1&${__url_time_range}&${validatorjob:queryparam}&${namespacepattern:queryparam}&${cluster:queryparam}&${Source:queryparam})\n- [Validator Detail](/d/community-validator_detail?orgId=1&${__url_time_range}&${validatorjob:queryparam}&${namespacepattern:queryparam}&${cluster:queryparam}&${Source:queryparam})\n- [Validator Streams](/d/community-validator_streams?orgId=1&${__url_time_range}&${validatorjob:queryparam}&${namespacepattern:queryparam}&${cluster:queryparam}&${Source:queryparam})\n\n## Sequencer\n\n- [Sequencer Summary](/d/community-sequencer_summary?orgId=1&${__url_time_range}&${sequencerjob:queryparam}&${namespacepattern:queryparam}&${cluster:queryparam}&${Source:queryparam})\n- [Sequencer Detail](/d/community-sequencer_detail?orgId=1&${__url_time_range}&${sequencerjob:queryparam}&${namespacepattern:queryparam}&${cluster:queryparam}&${Source:queryparam})\n\n## Relay\n\n- [Relay Summary](/d/community-relays_summary?orgId=1&${__url_time_range}&${relayjob:queryparam}&${namespacepattern:queryparam}&${cluster:queryparam}&${Source:queryparam})\n- [Relay Detail](/d/community-relays_detail?orgId=1&${__url_time_range}&${relayjob:queryparam}&${namespacepattern:queryparam}&${cluster:queryparam}&${Source:queryparam})\n\n## Nitro Node\n\n- [Nitro Node Summary](/d/community-nitro_summary?orgId=1&${__url_time_range}&${nitronodejob:queryparam}&${namespacepattern:queryparam}&${cluster:queryparam}&${Source:queryparam})\n- [Nitro Node Detail](/d/community-nitro_detail?orgId=1&${__url_time_range}&${nitronodejob:queryparam}&${namespacepattern:queryparam}&${cluster:queryparam}&${Source:queryparam})\n\n## Timeboost\n\n- [Timeboost Summary](/d/community-timeboost_summary?orgId=1&${__url_time_range}&${namespacepattern:queryparam}&${cluster:queryparam}&${Source:queryparam})\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": " ",
      "transparent": false,
      "type": "text"
    }
